[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0010","text":"到达现场是中午……────\n接送的拍摄巴士在北口便利店旁边…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0020","text":"小糸酱，你背下来了？\n真靠谱～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0030","text":"是、是吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0040","text":"时间表确认完毕，然后…………\n呀，已经这个点了…………────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0050","text":"（好困……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0070","text":"呀……！　透酱睡着了────\n……等等……雏菜酱也……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0080","text":"目的地是终点站，睡过站也没关系吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0090","text":"大、大家怎么都这么不靠谱啊……！\n我会醒着的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000500_02_0100","text":"……要、要保持清醒……\n不能睡……"}]
